{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"zettel.1777272449635","title":"Developer AI sebaiknya fokus pada composition, bukan membangun foundational model sendiri","desc":"Quote oven/chef merangkum filosofi praktis buku: nilai AI untuk developer ada di menyusun model dan sistem yang sudah ada, bukan di melatih model dari nol.","updated":1777276341256,"created":1777272449632,"tags":["zettel","ai","developer","composition","the-developers-guide-to-ai","introduction"],"custom":{},"fname":"zettel.1777272449635","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"8322a09201a521a4ae4b67f23387ddfe","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449635","id":"zettel.1777272449635","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.zettel","alias":"zettel","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.zettel"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449635","id":"zettel.1777272449635","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.ai","alias":"ai","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.ai"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449635","id":"zettel.1777272449635","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.developer","alias":"developer","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.developer"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449635","id":"zettel.1777272449635","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.composition","alias":"composition","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.composition"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449635","id":"zettel.1777272449635","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.the-developers-guide-to-ai","alias":"the-developers-guide-to-ai","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.the-developers-guide-to-ai"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449635","id":"zettel.1777272449635","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.introduction","alias":"introduction","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.introduction"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449635","id":"zettel.1777272449635","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"zettel.literature.the-developers-guide-to-ai","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":3,"offset":1567},"end":{"line":25,"column":51,"offset":1615},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"zettel.literature.the-developers-guide-to-ai"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449635","id":"zettel.1777272449635","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai","position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":3,"offset":1618},"end":{"line":26,"column":48,"offset":1663},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai"}},{"from":{"fname":"zettel.moc.the-developers-guide-to-ai","id":"zettel.moc.the-developers-guide-to-ai","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":8,"column":3,"offset":382},"end":{"line":8,"column":27,"offset":406},"indent":[]},"value":"zettel.1777272449635"}],"anchors":{"ide-inti":{"type":"header","text":"Ide inti","value":"ide-inti","line":19,"column":0,"depth":2},"supporting-quote":{"type":"header","text":"Supporting quote","value":"supporting-quote","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2},"kenapa-ini-penting":{"type":"header","text":"Kenapa ini penting","value":"kenapa-ini-penting","line":27,"column":0,"depth":2},"implikasi":{"type":"header","text":"Implikasi","value":"implikasi","line":31,"column":0,"depth":2},"sumber":{"type":"header","text":"Sumber","value":"sumber","line":39,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"zettel","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"developer-ai-sebaiknya-fokus-pada-composition-bukan-membangun-foundational-model-sendiri\">Developer AI sebaiknya fokus pada composition, bukan membangun foundational model sendiri<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#developer-ai-sebaiknya-fokus-pada-composition-bukan-membangun-foundational-model-sendiri\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"ide-inti\">Ide inti<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#ide-inti\"></a></h2>\n<p>Yang gue tangkap dari quote \"Why bother baking the oven when you can focus on being the chef?\" adalah bahwa developer AI tidak harus membangun foundational model dari nol untuk menciptakan nilai. Nilai praktis lebih datang dari kemampuan memilih, menggabungkan, dan memakai model pretrained serta sistem pendukungnya untuk menyelesaikan masalah nyata.</p>\n<h2 id=\"supporting-quote\">Supporting quote<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#supporting-quote\"></a></h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>“Why bother baking the oven when you can focus on being the chef?”</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"kenapa-ini-penting\">Kenapa ini penting<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#kenapa-ini-penting\"></a></h2>\n<p>Menurut gue quote ini melucuti asumsi salah yang sering bikin orang ragu nyoba AI: seolah lo harus ngerti semua matematika, riset, dan training model dari nol dulu. Padahal kalau tujuan lo adalah bikin solusi yang berguna, lebih masuk akal pakai fondasi yang sudah ada dan fokus ke lapisan nilai di atasnya.</p>\n<h2 id=\"implikasi\">Implikasi<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#implikasi\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\"Oven\" mencakup beban besar: training foundational model, riset arsitektur, infrastruktur ML, dan data skala massal.</li>\n<li>\"Chef\" mencakup kemampuan memilih bahan, meracik komponen, memahami konteks, dan menyesuaikan hasil dengan kebutuhan pengguna.</li>\n<li>Ini bukan anti-ilmu dasar; ini anti-false prerequisite yang menyatakan bahwa lo harus menguasai semuanya sebelum mulai bangun sesuatu yang berguna.</li>\n<li>Di konteks buku ini, itu berarti prioritasnya adalah pretrained models, prompt engineering, retrieval/RAG, fine-tuning seperlunya, dan agent/tool orchestration.</li>\n<li>Ide ini juga mengingatkan bahwa developer AI adalah system builder yang memutuskan kapan dan di mana melakukan custom work, bukan sekadar membuat ulang seluruh substrate.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"sumber\">Sumber<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#sumber\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Introduction</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.literature.the-developers-guide-to-ai\">The Developer's Guide to AI sebagai literature note</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai\">The Developer's Guide to AI</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a class=\"color-tag\" style=\"--tag-color: #a03623;\" href=\"/sotoy/notes/tags.zettel\">zettel</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">ai (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">developer (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">composition (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">the-developers-guide-to-ai (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">introduction (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.moc.the-developers-guide-to-ai\">MOC The Developer's Guide to AI</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"enableMarker":false},"copyNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"title"},"templateHierarchy":"template"},"workspace":{"dendronVersion":"0.83.0